 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "JO\u00c3O"
   ],
   "text": "Este. This one is stubborn.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "joao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE"
   ],
   "text": "How long since the last questioning?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "JO\u00c3O (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Two days. He still insists he is only a horseman.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "duarte",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE"
   ],
   "text": "You understand our language, senhor marata?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Enough to know when I am being lied to, Father.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "But you can speak your questions. I have heard most of them already.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "JO\u00c3O"
   ],
   "text": "You see. He understands.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "joao"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE"
   ],
   "text": "Bring him.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE"
   ],
   "text": "Nagoji Sawant. The Viceroy's spies insist you were huzurat cavalry under Chimaji Appa himself.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE"
   ],
   "text": "What we do not know is who ordered the attacks, how many men you had, and which forts you meant to strike next.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You know more than I do, then.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You have maps and books. You draw lines on paper and call them borders.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "My horse does not read.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "JO\u00c3O"
   ],
   "text": "Your horse is dead. We shot it when we brought you in.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "joao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "JO\u00c3O"
   ],
   "text": "A pity. Fine animal.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "joao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Then he died better than I will.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE"
   ],
   "text": "Tell me this at least, Nagoji. Not for the Viceroy. For me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE"
   ],
   "text": "Do you believe you fight for God, for some higher good, or is it simply for plunder and the honour of your people?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I fight because I was born into a world where men who do not fight are trampled.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "As for God, Father, I leave Him to the Brahmins and to you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "He seems to favour whoever has the better powder.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "JO\u00c3O (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You see. He gives you nothing. Let me loosen his tongue.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE"
   ],
   "text": "Not yet.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "duarte",
    "joao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE"
   ],
   "text": "The Viceroy needs a hand that can still hold a quill.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte",
    "joao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-06",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE"
   ],
   "text": "Enough.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-06",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "JO\u00c3O (off)"
   ],
   "text": "He still holds back names.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "duarte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-06",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "DUARTE"
   ],
   "text": "A dead prisoner cannot testify.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "duarte"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRISONER"
   ],
   "text": "They are gathering us for transport. South. By ship. For labour.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  }
 ]
}